			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"Although it requires &6Blue Steel&r to make and takes up far more space, the &6Large Steam Turbine&r is far more scalable than its predecessor."
				""
				"Only the &6Rotor Holder&r needs upgrading every tier, improving power generation by &e2x&r each time."
				""
				"You should also look into the &3Large Titanium Boiler&r in the near future to produce enough &9Steam&r to feed it."
				""
				"Your pipes may be a bottleneck with this level of &9Steam&r throughput however, so make sure to upgrade them!"
			]
