		{
			dependencies: ["1A30472430354F1E"]
			description: [
				"&6Steam Turbine Generators&r are the easiest way to start generating &eEU&r with &bGregTech&r, removing the need for a &6Converter&r."
				""
				"&9Steam&r can be input on any side other than the side with the red square around a wire, which is reserved for &eEU&r output."
				""
				"Note that all steam turbines accept any type of &9Steam&r, including those from &bThermal Systeams&r boilers."
			]
			id: "34876F54406B6A04"
			progression_mode: "flexible"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1433B9815BA2C6F1"
				item: "gtceu:lv_steam_turbine"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -9.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"6974AA409CC355E6"
				"785C6332FC7A07A5"
			]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"The Large Combustion Engine is much like an &5EV&r upgrade to an &6HV&r combustion Generator, but with a few differences."
				""
				"First, it's a multiblock. This means it takes up more space, requires a &6Maintenance Hatch&r, and costs a significant amount of Titanium."
				""
				"Second, it consumes &9Lubricant&r in addition to regular combustion fuels."
				""
				"Third, it can be supercharged with &9Oxygen&r to produce &e3x&r more energy from &e2x&r more fuel."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"While you're at it, you should also look into switching to \"},{\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Cetane Boosted Diesel\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0D0A0C18ED958511\"}},{\"text\":\" or \"},{\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"text\":\"High Octane Gasoline\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2CC50101A39EA2C0\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
				""
				"In addition to being more efficient, both of these fuels have an additional use in smelting &6Cryolobus&r later on."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:large_combustion_engine"
			id: "677D081CD7612FB0"
