		{
			dependencies: ["1A30472430354F1E"]
			description: [
				"It's a little difficult to produce energy using combustion in &7LV&r, but if you have easy access to a nearby &9Oil&r spout it may be beneficial to you; &6Combustion Generators&r can use both &9Raw Oil&r and &9Light Oil&r for power."
				""
				"However, burning &9Oil&r for power isn't very efficient. You'll want to distill the &9Oil&r if you want to make better use of the stuff."
			]
			id: "685330660E88E827"
			tasks: [{
