			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"&bMV&r opens up chemistry and distillation, unlocking more efficient fuels."
				""
				"[\"\",{\"text\":\"In particular, you should aim for oil distillates like \"},{\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Light Fuel\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0E20199737DFE4AC\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Heavy Fuel\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1F2E76FA4B2C2E84\"}},{\"text\":\", or \"},{\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":\"true\",\"text\":\"Naphtha.\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"04BDE09518C184E4\"}}]"
				""
				"These fuels will become of use as your fuel demands increase - each new tier of generator consumes 4x as much fuel as the previous tier to produce 4x as much &eEU&r."
			]
			id: "63B27CA5BB60B740"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3F91A33584716219"
