			description: ["In &bMV&r, you unlock new gasses that are cheaper to produce or last longer in your generators. In particular, &9Refinery Gas&r and &9LPG&r are good options at this stage. You'll likely need one of them, as &6Advanced Gas Turbine Generators&r consume 4x as much fuel to generate 4x as much &eEU&r."]
