			description: [
				"The &3Antimatter Collider&r is a large multiblock that can generate more energy than you will be able to transport."
				""
				"It does so by gathering energy from the annihilation of &6Antimatter Fuel&r and one of two collidants: &6Neutronium&r or &6Infinity&r."
				""
				"When building the collider, note that each ring of &6Netherite Casing&r must have its own fluid input hatch, and that only single fluid hatches are accepted."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&cOnce the collider is turned on, all fluids in both hatches will be constantly consumed.&r Energy will be created for equal amounts of matter and antimatter, with a bonus multiplier for larger batches of collidants."
				""
				"&eExcess of either fluid will be destroyed&r. Energy created that doesn't fit into the dynamo/laser hatch &ewill be lost&r."
